  "text": "Conaire is an Irish hero of the sagas. He came to Tara as a naked man with birds all around. His mother was of the race of birds. A dream told him to come to Tara without clothes. He obeyed the dream and the prophecy came true. The Scottish Highlanders knew a like rite. They bound a seer in bulls hides and left him to dream of the future. In 1769 a man at Trotternish was sewn into an oxhide. He slept under a high waterfall to win foresight.",
